post/wangshuo5/</guid><description>Liutex涡定义与第三代涡识别方法在二维流场的应用</description></item><item><title>HITRAN 数据库用法</title><link>https://liuxunchen.github.io/xliu-group/zh/post/xliu-15-hitran-database/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Nov 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://liuxunchen.github.io/xliu-group/zh/post/xliu-15-hitran-database/</guid><description>HITRAN 数据库 line by line 计算代码</description></item><item><title>冉佳兴</title><link>https://liuxunchen.github.io/xliu-group/zh/people/ranjiaxing/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Oct 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://liuxunchen.github.io/xliu-group/zh/people/ranjiaxing/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Graduate Student
